{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "be75ac5b-3a86-86a9-8e06-498dab027e2a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T11:35:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Before anything else, what was your name again? I want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kevin. K-E-V-I-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kevin. Thank you. Okay, I'm Teresa Moniz. I know it's Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I wasn't sure this was the right number, but it was the one on the recorded message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're good. The storm line stays open on weekends. What's going on, Mrs. Moniz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a tree down across my driveway. It came down in the wind from that coastal storm that ended yesterday. I can't get the car out, and I'm a little nervous about it, honestly, because part of it is leaning toward the porch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "242 Ocean Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side. Hold on, one moment, I'm looking for the remote, it's somewhere in these couch cushions, the television is going and I can't hear you well. [pause] There. I turned it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:34:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is the tree on your property, or is it out by the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my tree, I think. It's in my yard, but it fell across the driveway and the end of it is in the road a bit. So my question is, who do I call about this? Is it the city that takes care of it, or me, or the electric company? I don't want to call the wrong one and lose a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Any part in the public road, we'll look at, so I'll write that up. If it's a tree on your own property, clearing it is usually the owner's job. And if there are any wires on it or touching it, that's the utility, not us. Do you see any wires?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me write that down. Road, city. Yard, me. Wires, utility. No, I don't see wires. The wires are across the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So I'm noting a downed tree, 242 Ocean Avenue, partly in the roadway, blocking the driveway, no wires. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:35:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll send this to the crew for the road part. They're busy after the storm, so I can't give you a time, but it's logged. For the rest, you'll want a private tree service."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Kevin. I have it all written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T11:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You take care, Mrs. Moniz."
    }
  ],
